      <h2>1. What SENTINEL MAN Is — and Is Not</h2>
      <p>SENTINEL MAN is a performance intelligence system. It processes your self-reported operational data and uses artificial intelligence to generate personalised daily briefs, decision assessments, and pattern intelligence.</p>
      <p><strong>SENTINEL MAN is not:</strong></p>
      <ul>
        <li>A medical service or medical device</li>
        <li>A mental health service or psychological treatment</li>
        <li>A substitute for professional clinical care</li>
        <li>A licensed financial or legal advisory service</li>
        <li>A diagnostic tool</li>
      </ul>
      <p>The intelligence SENTINEL MAN provides is based on the data you enter and AI reasoning applied to that data. It is designed to support your thinking — not to replace your judgment, and not to replace professional advice in any domain.</p>
      <div class="callout">If you are experiencing a mental health crisis, contact <strong>Lifeline on 13 11 14</strong> (Australia) or your local emergency services.</div>

      <h2>2. Who Can Use SENTINEL MAN</h2>
      <p>You must be:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>At least 18 years of age</li>
        <li>A natural person (individuals only — not automated accounts or bots)</li>
