      <h3>4.4 Automatic Renewal</h3>
      <p>Subscriptions renew automatically unless you cancel before the renewal date. You will receive an email reminder 7 days before each annual renewal. Monthly subscriptions renew without a reminder.</p>

      <h3>4.5 Cancellation</h3>
      <p>You may cancel your subscription at any time via:</p>
