      <p>Cancellation takes effect at the end of the current billing period. You retain access until that date.</p>

      <h3>4.6 Refunds</h3>
      <p><strong>Monthly subscriptions:</strong> No refund is issued for the current billing period upon cancellation. Access continues until the period ends.</p>
      <p><strong>Annual subscriptions:</strong> If you cancel within 14 days of your annual renewal date and have not used the service during that period, you may request a refund of the annual subscription fee. Submit refund requests to <a href="mailto:support@sentinelman.com">support@sentinelman.com</a> within 14 days of the charge.</p>
